    "write": "The rye is ready at ten. It takes two days, so there are forty loaves.",
    "avoid": "Indulge in our delicious artisanal breads, lovingly handcrafted daily!",
    "letter": "Thank you for ordering the wedding loaves. We will start the levain on Thursday evening and bake on Saturday at five, so the bread reaches you still warm."
